{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/bfcc47533a6f5ffdeb4664b36df6c3f3.avif?t=1757706466\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant vegetables, water your crops, and harvest them to earn money and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use those resources to build machines, defenses, and upgrade your tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive incoming waves of enemies by farming efficiently and defending your chicken at all costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/478dd59467a67b7073e726ab45bd47bd.avif?t=1757706466\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.poster.avif?t=1757706466\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.webm?t=1757706466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.mp4?t=1757706466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your fields, unlock new seeds, and automate your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crop counts when the next wave is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/03ae225115b5d23f091db08d8bc6602b.avif?t=1757706466\" width=900 heigh